ion, the company engages in the wholesale distribution of food and beverages ingredients to restaurants. The company was formerly known as Disccomp Berhad and changed its name to Pineapple Resources Berhad in November 2012. Pineapple Resources Berhad was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia. Pineapple Resources Berhad is a former subsidiary of Chuan Huat Holdings Sdn Bhd.","zh":"Pineapple Resources Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚从事电脑硬件、软件、外设、配件及打印耗材的零售与分销。公司前身为 Disccomp Berhad，于2012年11月更名为现名，2000年成立，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。公司通过信息技术（IT）相关产品零售和餐饮运营两个分部开展业务。","lines":["IT产品零售与分销：通过零售门店和线上平台向消费者销售电脑硬件、软件、外设、配件及打印耗材。","Bhai Jim Jum品牌餐饮：运营Bhai Jim Jum品牌旗下的食品饮料门店。","PappaRich品牌餐厅：拥有并特许经营PappaRich品牌餐厅。","餐饮原料批发分销：向餐厅批发分销食品饮料原料。"],"lines_en":["IT product retail and distribution: sells computer hardware, software, peripherals, accessories, and printing consumables to consumers through retail outlets and online platforms.","Bhai Jim Jum F&B outlets: operates food and beverage outlets under the Bhai Jim Jum brand.","PappaRich restaurants: owns and franchises PappaRich brand restaurants.","F&B ingredient wholesale distribution: wholesales food and beverage ingredients to restaurants."]}}